    {
      "id": "2196d9ad-3f78-5f2b-9b06-74381b452b0d",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "{name} 선수가 숙소 거실에 혼자 앉아 창밖을 보고 있다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "{name} is sitting alone in the dorm living room, staring out the window.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa08952c-8187-58ea-b247-84decac056e6",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "요즘 좀 생각이 많아서요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I've just had a lot on my mind lately.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ce7eaa06-c2b7-5fe1-a374-af85b9dc7e8a",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "면담 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "2196d9ad-3f78-5f2b-9b06-74381b452b0d"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "cf1f3b23-6291-52e9-99f2-f62bbf6918b5": "interview",
        "06d29a16-dd4a-52ea-b24b-5189ad841a9d": -1,
        "66cd505c-e1b1-5b8d-8897-c76868ef3fa8": 0,
        "769d1bb4-0568-53ae-a71d-38ea996b8e66": "",
        "944e245a-0c29-555e-9791-c614641b4db3": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "477e32f2-d0b6-5af1-8c19-90491d066437",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "d1087154-782b-529f-9333-199d66800c93",
          "text": "무슨 일 있어? 천천히 말해 봐.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "eb7df1b0-3ee0-5a4d-93f5-7f99954aee23": "ok>trust:+6;ng>trust:+2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "9ee8f7c6-3867-521e-a235-7918332b9e75",
          "text": "컨디션 관리도 실력이야.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "eb7df1b0-3ee0-5a4d-93f5-7f99954aee23": "trust:-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "729109ed-2cd1-57d4-9e6e-92d578797b13",
          "text": "내일 얘기하자. 오늘은 쉬어.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "eb7df1b0-3ee0-5a4d-93f5-7f99954aee23": "trust:+2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:d1087154-782b-529f-9333-199d66800c93": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Something wrong? Take your time.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:9ee8f7c6-3867-521e-a235-7918332b9e75": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Managing your condition is part of the job.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:729109ed-2cd1-57d4-9e6e-92d578797b13": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's talk tomorrow. Get some rest tonight.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "83ae2a06-4f76-5722-96ec-c7c88c75898f",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "들어 주셔서 감사해요. 한결 낫네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Thanks for listening. I feel a lot better.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "682f2a66-fcaa-5c12-a7ad-49dbaa1bb56e": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8fa1d384-aa59-5074-8069-899ce3b94f7c",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "아니에요. 그냥 피곤한가 봐요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "It's nothing. I guess I'm just tired.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "682f2a66-fcaa-5c12-a7ad-49dbaa1bb56e": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "36da7a55-9a7e-57f1-9ef6-0ea073d23071",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네. 알고 있어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Yeah. I know.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ef0d8c5-9481-5b1c-b03d-603536c38cbb",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네 감독님. 푹 잘게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Got it, Coach. I'll get a good night's sleep.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
